    "chunk_text": "maha_super_flexi: In this Home loan scheme, the borrowers’ account is linked to a dedicated savings account. So, when a borrower deposits the surplus money to the account, it will be considered credit towards the loan, thus reducing the interest on the outstanding loan amount."
  },
  {
    "chunk_text": "maha_super_flexi: Also, if needed, the borrower has option to withdraw money whenever required. The loan will get rebalanced accordingly."
  },
